<ModMetaData>
  <name>Genesis</name>
  <author>Cruesoe</author>
  <packageId>cruesoe.genesis</packageId>
  <supportedVersions>
    <li>1.6</li>
  </supportedVersions>
  <description>A progression overhaul that takes your colony through the eras, from tribal beginnings to spacer technology. Each era ends in a capstone project; finishing it advances your colony to the next era, with a short celebration as it happens.

Research covers everything from furniture, storage, cooking and production to drugs, mechanoids, apparel, weapons, factories and gravships, and fits in with a wide range of other mods. Support for other mods is only touched when they&apos;re active.

Built on ferny&apos;s Progression mods. Huge thanks to ferny for the original mods and all the Progression work this builds on. Do not use it alongside the Progression or ProgressionLESS mods.</description>
